==Latin==

===Etymology===
{{unk|la}}. Possibilities include:
* {{der|la|ine-pro|*ǵómbʰos|*ǵembʰ-|nail, tooth}};
* Proto-Italic {{m|itc-pro|*gen-||to produce}}, from {{m+|ine-pro|*ǵenh₁-}}; compare {{m|la|gignō}} and {{m|la|genus}};
* A non-Indo-European {{der|la|qfa-sub}} source. The unusual form of the word, the lack of clear cognates and the semantic category of the word make this hypothesis likely.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA}}

===Noun===
{{la-noun|gemma<1>}}

